MultiKeys audit remediation phase 1 (pico-fido): length and bounds checks on host-controlled input.
Ports of upstream fixes (polhenarejos/pico-fido): b1df38d (pinHashEnc length), db4e0e8 (PIN_AUTH_BLOCKED in
getPinToken), 76e3333 (credential_verify length guard, extended to the old format), 8992174/7633fc8 (U2F
key-handle length, calloc NULL). Not ported: 4ad31d1, d5c28ab.
MultiKeys additions: decrypt() block-size checks, ecdh() error handling + pubkey check, credential_load calloc,
credMgmt walk state copy, duplicate CBOR byte/text keys rejected, EA CSR free, management tlv zero-length,
AUT_ENABLE/AUT_DISABLE removed.

